# Reporting (proportional)

Do not write 30-section forensic reports for trivial work. Task prompts may override path/level.

| Level | When | Output |
|-------|------|--------|
| **L0** | Trivial Q&A | Chat only |
| **L1** | Small analysis/fix | Short chat contract; optional tiny md |
| **L2** | Feature / device / release / process analysis with decisions | `android/app/build/outputs/<topic>/NAME.md` |
| **L3** | Multi-episode forensics | Dedicated folder + SUMMARY; update `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` if status changed |

## Defaults

- Meaningful ANALYSIS / IMPLEMENTATION / EXECUTION with decisions → at least L2 unless the prompt says otherwise
- Prefer updating `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` over spawning near-duplicate Case notes when only status moved
- Case1/Case2 deep timelines stay in existing forensics folders — link, do not re-paste
